Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:50.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們走慣的道路到底在何方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}偶爾因世態炎涼惱火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只是身在福中不知福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:58.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}火光亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}指引方向
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:06.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}回憶中響起了溫柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:12.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
